1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I feel uncomfortable with this.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:09,000
It seems lying to Jose, but the staff told me this is the only magic bullet to get him to take them.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:19,000
And we have the family's consent to have medication given inside the apple sauce if Jose refuses medication.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Jose, look what I have for you.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:37,000
I brought your favorite treat, crushed apple.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
He took it, but... I feel like a liar.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Am I really helping him?
